      "order": 3,
      "depth": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram: \nMoolavar: Vadivazhagiya Nambi\nUtsavar: Sundarajan\nThayaar: Azhyagiyavalli Thayaar\nViamnam: Taraka Viamanam\nPushkarani: Mandooka-Pushkarani\nTravel: This kshethram is located very close to Lalgudi.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram: \nTirumazhisai Azhwar – 1 \n\nPratyaksham: Brahma, Shivan, Urvashi, Valmiki, Mandooka Maharishi",
